  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Aha! Wizard! You're not going to believe it! According to the data, there's actually been a Spiral-wide decrease in Pekrons recently!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AegonStatz_MIR_01.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Now, it was nearly infinitesimal, and well within the statistical margin of error, but still... it's worth noting.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AegonStatz_MIR_02.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The question is - what could have caused it? If we can discern the reason, we may have a clue towards combating this menace!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AegonStatz_MIR_03.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Here's what I need! Take your Gravulum Badge and get a sampling from three Worlds - Marleybone, Zafaria, and Polaris - that should do.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AegonStatz_MIR_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You're back! Let me have a look... Great Scott! The Pekron concentrations in those Worlds are now showing an uptick! I... can't understand.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AegonStatz_MIR_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Of course, it is only one one-millionth of a percent. Perhaps we should collect more data before jumping to conclusions. Yes. Talk to you soon!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AegonStatz_MIR_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC11_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Strange. I can't get a clear remote reading. There's interference. Something peculiar is afoot. I'll just check your badge when you return.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/AegonStatz_MIR_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1378050,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
